Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 03:59:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(crafting): support the player 2x2 recipe grid

Match and preview Bedrock recipes in the player inventory without storing the Java preview in the transient Bedrock output slot. Share recipe placement planning with crafting tables, route player recipe-book requests to HUD slots 28-31, and refresh the preview after server corrections.
